                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I introduced the TEMP Act with @SenMarcoRubio to direct the Risk Management Agency to research and develop a crop insurance policy to cover losses caused by cold exposure and freezes.\n\nOur bipartisan bill creates an affordable index temperature policy, providing much-needed stability and coverage for Florida\u2019s more than 300 specialty crops should temperatures drop below freezing.\n\nThanks to co-sponsors: @RepDarrenSoto @RepGregSteube @RepMillsPress",
